TTER-SPACING: 0pt\">: 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">예비창업자 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">고등학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">휴학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">및 창업 예정자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">기창업자 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">: 3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">년 미만 창업자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(2016. 1. 1 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">이후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">※ 팀 단위 참가시 </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\"><u>5명 이내로 제한하며, ‘예비창업자’팀의 경우, 구성원 중 기창업자가 없어야 함</u></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">지원분야 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">보건산업 전 분야</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">제약</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">의료기기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">헬스케어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">화장품</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">뷰티</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">식품 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style