 COLOR: #000000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">’, ‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000000\">예비창업패키지 지원 사업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">’ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000000\">지원시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000000\">가점 적용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">홈페이지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">: </span><a href=\"http://biostartup.jobkorea.co.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" data-cke-saved-href=\"http://biostartup.jobkorea.co.kr\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: rgb(128,0,128); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">http://biostartup.jobkorea.co.kr</span></strong></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><img title=\"\" src=\"http://job.kumoh.ac.kr/kit/upload/fckfile/file/%C6%F7%BD%BA%C5%CD29.jpg\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
